  "nginx サービスの状態（稼働中か・直近のログ）を確認するコマンドを入力してください。": "Type the command that shows the nginx service's state (whether it is running, and its latest logs).",
  "`systemctl status` は Active 状態・メインプロセス・直近のジャーナル数行をまとめて表示します。": "`systemctl status` shows the Active state, the main process and the last few journal lines together.",
