  "root 前提のイメージ（80 番で待ち受け、/var/cache に書き込み）は Permission denied で CrashLoopBackOff になる": "Images that assume root (listening on 80, writing to /var/cache) end up in CrashLoopBackOff with Permission denied",
  "基本の対処は非 root 対応イメージへの置き換え（例: 8080 で待ち受ける unprivileged 版）と、グループ 0 に書き込み権限を与えるイメージ設計": "The basic fix is to switch to an image that runs as non-root (for example an unprivileged build listening on 8080), designed so group 0 can write",
  "`anyuid` などの SCC 付与は最終手段。専用の ServiceAccount に限定し、理由を記録する": "Granting an SCC such as `anyuid` is a last resort. Limit it to a dedicated ServiceAccount and record why",
  "プロジェクト権限: `oc adm policy add-role-to-user edit alice -n shop`": "Project permissions: `oc adm policy add-role-to-user edit alice -n shop`",
  "nginx が `bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (13: Permission denied)` で落ちる。原因は？": "nginx dies with `bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (13: Permission denied)`. Why?",
  "restricted-v2 SCC により非 root の任意 UID で動くため、1024 未満のポートを使えない": "Under the restricted-v2 SCC it runs as an arbitrary non-root UID, so it cannot use ports below 1024",
  "Route が作られていない": "No Route has been created",
  "ノードのファイアウォール": "The node's firewall",
