  "上の問題への推奨対処は？": "What is the recommended fix for the problem above?",
  "非 root で動く（8080 などで待ち受ける）イメージに置き換える": "Switch to an image that runs as non-root (listening on 8080 or similar)",
  "default ServiceAccount に anyuid を付与する": "Grant anyuid to the default ServiceAccount",
  "privileged SCC を付与する": "Grant the privileged SCC",
