  "`anyuid` SCC を付与するときの注意点は？": "What should you watch out for when granting the `anyuid` SCC?",
  "その ServiceAccount で動く Pod は root を含む任意の UID で動けるため、専用 SA に限定して最小範囲にする": "Pods running under that ServiceAccount can run as any UID, root included, so limit it to a dedicated SA and keep the scope minimal",
