  "OLM（Operator Lifecycle Manager）: OperatorHub から Subscription で導入。チャネルと承認方式（Automatic / Manual）で更新を管理": "OLM (Operator Lifecycle Manager): install from OperatorHub with a Subscription. Updates are managed with channels and an approval mode (Automatic / Manual)",
  "プラットフォーム自体も Cluster Operator が管理: `oc get clusteroperators`（Available / Progressing / Degraded）": "The platform itself is managed by Cluster Operators too: `oc get clusteroperators` (Available / Progressing / Degraded)",
