  "OCP 4 のノードは RHCOS。OS 設定は Machine Config Operator（MCO）が MachineConfig で宣言的に管理する": "OCP 4 nodes run RHCOS. OS settings are managed declaratively with MachineConfig by the Machine Config Operator (MCO)",
