  "アップデートは Cluster Version Operator（CVO）がチャネル（stable / fast / eus など）に従って実行: `oc adm upgrade`": "Updates are run by the Cluster Version Operator (CVO) following a channel (stable / fast / eus and so on): `oc adm upgrade`",
  "Machine API: MachineSet でノードを増減。ClusterAutoscaler / MachineAutoscaler で自動化": "Machine API: add and remove nodes with a MachineSet. Automate it with ClusterAutoscaler / MachineAutoscaler",
